   "stem": {
      "text": "Consider the differential equation \\( \\frac{dy}{dx} = e^{x - y} \\). Find the particular solution \\( y = f(x) \\) with \\( f(0) = \\ln{\\left(2 \\right)} \\), written as an explicit function of \\( x \\)."
